[{"title":"得张主事廷实书 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"三口丘园旧，离群迹半更。\n几时重见面，中夜独驰情。\n眠食今何似，头颅尚可成。\n定山名教顶，贺老却登瀛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42630,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得张主事廷实书 其四","author":"陈献章","text":"持烛圭峰寺，宵谈仆屡更。\n一为方外友，都没世间情。\n面壁僧犹在，栽莲社未成。\n孤舟破危浪，载月下东瀛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42631,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵寄潘时用","author":"陈献章","text":"文章豪自寄，丘壑静还更。\n久病依人世，长贫惬妇情。\n人为知己惜，天与后生成。\n更约齐州外，从吾泛大瀛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42632,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"久雨","author":"陈献章","text":"树隐云深黑，篱崩水乱流。\n凌风快燕子，上壁定蜗牛。\n老更怜儿病，人多为草忧。\n朝朝稽叔夜，谁办不梳头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42633,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用韵寄姜进士仁夫","author":"陈献章","text":"书爱八分小，来书喻率更。\n云霄初接武，江海尚留情。\n世事非难料，人才怕小成。\n诸贤须汲汲，吾老独观瀛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42634,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用韵寄林缉熙平湖","author":"陈献章","text":"秋怀耿不寐，更静复闻更。\n水向漫漫注，心含种种情。\n士应强到底，官岂怠将成。\n旧业罗浮外，东南望隔瀛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42635,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用韵效寒山 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"贫贱耻为拙，富荣常好更。\n高论古今事，中怀名利情。\n堂堂无复见，小小或能成。\n浪说神仙在，从来不住瀛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42636,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用韵效寒山 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"四郊多窃盗，村里夜支更。\n为语长官道，能无患盗情。\n家家愁日暮，处处望秋成。\n饥鼯饱苍粟，苦海变蓬瀛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42637,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠刘程乡别","author":"陈献章","text":"肃庵今又别，酒醒望圭峰。\n秋色此溪树，暝烟何处钟。\n功名悲梦蝶，文字耻雕虫。\n故里荒坟在，归来拜一峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42638,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病疥用后山韵写怀 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"痒极肌难忍，爬深血有棱。\n老亲令就枕，小婢问留灯。\n屋漏频推瓦，床摇屡束藤。\n同袍谁问疾，端愧玉台僧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42639,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病疥用后山韵写怀 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"呻吟不尽痛，夕枕傍慈帏。\n安得身长健，朝朝见綵衣。\n无肤臀奄赤，乍肿臂疑肥。\n睡过西廊月，寒空淡不辉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42640,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病疥用后山韵写怀 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"缺月生残夜，微风引洞箫。\n心閒发少白，人老病难消。\n出户行看月，移舟钓落潮。\n酒钱不拄杖，著处解奴腰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42641,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠黎萧二生别","author":"陈献章","text":"白发孤灯坐，青春二妙来。\n若无天地量，争得圣胚胎。\n至乐终难说，真知不著猜。\n濛濛烟雨里，归思若为裁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42642,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野坐","author":"陈献章","text":"团盖青松午，重裀绿草春。\n野晴莺得意，花盛蝶伤神。\n断霭生西坞，残潮下暝津。\n竹根酣共卧，不觉藓沾身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42643,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"世传咏梅句，天下共称奇。\n花有无言妙，人间都未知。\n正嗟同赏绝，又过半开时。\n安得邵康节，为我问庖羲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42644,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"风月交游淡，江山几席閒。\n夜深花睡去，时有梦来还。\n引步寻香易，无心弄影难。\n乾坤留此妙，何处觅孤山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42645,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢客 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"客舫初辞岸，主翁仍在床。\n十年今转数，一饭故难偿。\n竹杪风生汗，天边雨送凉。\n所思黄叔度，岁晚得同堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42646,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢客 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"漾漾湖侵岸，萧萧风引旗。\n问儿打鼓处，是客发船时。\n鬻屦时将暮，迎门俗久衰。\n秖应巢许辈，掩口笑人痴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42647,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒雨中作","author":"陈献章","text":"有期久不至，旦旦问童奴。\n雨过荆扉湿，风回树叶疏。\n兴移剡溪舫，诗在灞桥驴。\n风韵今谁继，千年胜事虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42648,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中栽竹","author":"陈献章","text":"心被清虚引，非关索竹看。\n檐前才数个，淇上已千竿。\n微雨土初覆，北风天正寒。\n昆丘有孤凤，何处喙琅玕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42649,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"楚云台呈世卿 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"三杯拈铁篴，见月上瑶台。\n初弄山石裂，再轰仙鹤来。\n夜阑试静听，曲罢仍迟回。\n何必杨州去，前村多美醅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42650,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"楚云台呈世卿 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"行窝还几处，云水且吾台。\n雨脚风吹断，潮头月涌来。\n野桥牵木渡，沙径逐牛回。\n亦有采樵者，放歌行负醅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42651,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"楚云台呈世卿 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"有月严光濑，无金郭隗台。\n悠悠百年内，又见一人来。\n水槛秋逾好，山云暝欲回。\n相逢各心醉，一语浃春醅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42652,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"楚云台呈世卿 其四","author":"陈献章","text":"爽气通秋服，溪流静晚台。\n高楼多自惬，真赏复谁来。\n对月诗方妙，看山梦始回。\n市沽堪便醉，况乃是家醅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42653,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄吴明府同世卿游玉台","author":"陈献章","text":"圭峰雨初霁，策马向松关。\n流泉忽满涧，白云长在山。\n弃置千般事，来投半日閒。\n上方禅榻静，坐到暮钟还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42654,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"生日答吴明府献臣","author":"陈献章","text":"生日何人记，南枝报长官。\n酒香同客醉，花少避人看。\n后甲惟元祀，浮生又五寒。\n凭轩一长啸，风日满江山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42655,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寻梅饮李鸿宅用服周韵","author":"陈献章","text":"今晨风日佳，策杖去寻梅。\n独树山中老，危枝石上开。\n时看残腊尽，人望早春来。\n谁解忘情得，神功付此杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42656,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠世卿别 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"客路经南岳，湘帆背岳开。\n江湖閒老梦，岁月是君来。\n相见儿童喜，别离琴瑟哀。\n惟应楚云外，更起望仙台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42657,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠世卿别 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"岂无千日酒，花下与君同。\n客思朝临水，归旗夜引风。\n一槎当浦口，一枕在辽东。\n何事今为别，藤蓑还赠公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42658,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠世卿游山 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"万丈昆崙顶，冥栖忆老关。\n君看白龙水，何似黄公山。\n有酒终日醉，无官到处閒。\n南风乃何意，又送楚舟还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42659,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠世卿游山 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"朝来生紫气，此地一函关。\n帽顶花沾雨，云中人下山。\n相逢欲大笑，不语是真閒。\n晚向东亭醉，犹能骑马还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42660,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"世卿将归 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"会有还乡意，深惭不自量。\n母留儿作伴，妻为客求浆。\n台榜明朝旭，松堂闭夜凉。\n延缘过残夏，满意泛潇湘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42661,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"世卿将归 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"与君云水别，何梦得商量。\n合是真调鼎，能忘老卖浆。\n还山非早计，举棹是秋凉。\n有路通衡岳，无诗吊楚湘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42662,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠饶鉴","author":"陈献章","text":"君又去东津，东津月送人。\n周游千里道，细问百年身。\n野色淡将暝，江桃疑是春。\n丹青如可赠，画我小昆崙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42663,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花","author":"陈献章","text":"草木自有性，湖山更乞灵。\n冰霜仙骨瘦，桃李世情腥。\n惹袖香全别，和羹子未青。\n未须携铁笛，吹月上湖亭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42664,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜何竹窗重过白沙话旧赠之 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"此君为别久，不逐众芳彫。\n白葛身已老，青云郎独超。\n春风吹细浪，落日泛轻桡。\n楚云有高树，未肯挂公瓢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42665,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜何竹窗重过白沙话旧赠之 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"忆年四十许，公弟立如山。\n行止相料理，渔樵共往还。\n馀情空耿耿，秋鬓各斑斑。\n不是公怜我，清颜谁更攀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42666,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张地曹寄林县博用韵答之 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"无心云自在，得意鸟同歌。\n白骨可人醉，苍生如命何。\n渔樵真有道，烟水别传蓑。\n想见沧溟外，东南月更多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42667,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张地曹寄林县博用韵答之 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"安得李太白，樽前同尔歌。\n自从识象罔，未始离无何。\n草长游人路，风鸣桂树蓑。\n东邻古大嫂，掩口笑何多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42668,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和子长民泽论诗寄兴罗浮之作","author":"陈献章","text":"飞云干老梦，拉伴骋遥临。\n挥手谢人世，闻歌生我心。\n今年春又过，何处洞还深。\n相忆山楼暮，依依向远岑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42669,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再用韵示诸生","author":"陈献章","text":"贤圣低回久，千年想一临。\n希颜非乐道，疑孟失求心。\n逸驾行应速，寒泉汲务深。\n尝闻根本学，不尽泰山岑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointe